<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Houston Explore said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Houston Explore said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber started coverage of Houston Exploration Co with an attractive rating, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimates are $0.52 per share for 1996 and $0.56 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- 12-month price target is 22.</p>
</text>
